  diseaseId: pancreatitis
  diseaseName: "PANKREAT\u0130T"
  generalInfo: "Pankreatit, pankreas\u0131n iltihaplanmas\u0131yla geli\u015Fen ciddi
    bir sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda \xFCst kar\u0131n
    a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, bulant\u0131 ve kusma g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "\xDCst kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 var olmas\u0131, bulant\u0131
    ve kusma, s\u0131rta vuran a\u011Fr\u0131 ve hafif ate\u015F var olmas\u0131
    pankreatitte s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. A\u011Fr\u0131 orta-\u015Fiddetli
    olabilir."
